{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":14531,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:51:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:51:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-funzioni-siri-interfaccia-touch-stabilita\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove funzioni Siri, interfaccia touch e più stabilità\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo le indiscrezioni, macOS 27 arriverà a settembre dopo beta a giugno e luglio: app Siri dedicata, funzioni Apple Intelligence, ottimizzazioni touch e stop al supporto AFP.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14426,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T16:50:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T14:50:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-presenta-gpt-5-5-coding-agentico-ricerca\",\"title\":\"OpenAI presenta GPT-5.5: coding agentico e ricerca\",\"excerpt\":\"OpenAI ha annunciato GPT-5.5, un aggiornamento per ChatGPT e Codex. Il modello punta a migliorare lavori multi-step, uso di strumenti e verifica dell’output.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/openai-chatgpt-logo-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"openai-chatgpt-logo\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14386,\"date\":\"2026-04-22T23:40:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-22T21:40:33+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-cha